    {
      "game": "Hitman World of Assassination",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/12619/450x258/hitman-world-of-assassination-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1786348800",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/12619-buy-hitman-world-of-assassination-pc-steam/",
      "user": "Luka Review",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/31742708-1782248102.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "**Game: HITMAN World of Assassination**\n\n\n\n**Genre: Stealth / Action / Sandbox**\n\n\n\n Pros:\n\n\n\n**Gameplay & Freedom** – One of the best things about HITMAN is the freedom it gives you. There are countless ways to eliminate your targets, from carefully planned accidents to completely improvised approaches.\n\n\n\n**Maps & Level Design** – The locations are incredibly detailed and offer tons of opportunities to explore, disguise yourself, and create unique assassination setups. Every map feels different and encourages experimentation.\n\n\n\n**Replayability** – The game has an insane amount of replay value. With different challenges, disguises, weapons, starting locations, and assassination methods, you can replay the same mission many times and still discover something new.\n\n\n\nCons:\n\n\n\n**Some Repetitive Challenges** – While there is a huge amount of content, some challenges can start feeling repetitive after playing the same locations for a long time.\n\n\n\n**AI Can Be Strange** – NPC and guard AI can occasionally behave in weird or unpredictable ways, which can sometimes break immersion.\n\n\n\n**Online Requirements** – Some progression and features depend on being connected to the servers, which can be frustrating when the servers are unavailable.\n\n\n\nScore: 9.5/10\n\n\n\nOne of the best stealth games I’ve ever played. The freedom, creativity, and insane amount of content make HITMAN World of Assassination incredibly fun to play. It rewards both careful planning and complete chaos, and there is always another way to complete a mission."
    }
